  "_docFlying": "Towers with \"hitsFlying\": false (Catapult) never target flying enemies (enemy.json \"flying\") and their explosions do not hit them.",
  "_docHalo": "Halo Spire (kind 'halo'): attackSpeed = activations per second (only while enemies are on the field); its first activation of a wave raises its shield: one shield per spire per wave (a broken one stays down until the next wave); the buff of the nearby towers and the mending go on. attackRange = shield radius (fixed, range research never changes it). Shield HP = shieldHpPct % of the wall max HP, shield defense = shieldDefPct % of the wall defense (90 at most), both + 10 per Warding Halo level (research 'haloShield'). Only enemy projectiles are stopped (boss ones too). 'shield': loop / collapse sheets (played in real time, whatever the game speed); only the right part of the bubble is drawn and blocks (the side of the enemies): cells of cellW x cellH px, bubble center 'centerX' px from the left of a cell, the part right of center + 'keepFrom' x radius (bubble radius 'ringRadius' px in a cell). Needs research to be built (unlockKey), for its buff ('aura') and wall mending (mendEvery activations -> mendPct % of the missing wall HP).",
